<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>脏腑 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E8%84%8F%E8%85%91/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Mon, 22 Jun 2026 17:40:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E8%84%8F%E8%85%91/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>二论脏腑</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/5-15-erlunzangfu/</link><pubDate>Mon, 22 Jun 2026 17:35:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/5-15-erlunzangfu/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%94%E4%B9%A6%E9%9B%86/">卷五书集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》附篇“二论脏腑”，由&lt;strong&gt;雷公真君&lt;/strong&gt;论述五脏六腑之外的隐藏脏腑——&lt;strong&gt;胞胎为第六脏，膻中为第七腑&lt;/strong&gt;，并由张仲景真人评赞，李子永附论五脏用药特点。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;脏腑之数不止五六，胞胎为心肾交通之关、主生殖孕育；膻中为心包相火、为脾胃之母。明此方能全面把握生理病理&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>藏府经络先后病脉证第一</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/jingui-01/</link><pubDate>Tue, 24 Jun 2025 10:55:24 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/jingui-01/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E9%87%91%E5%8C%AE/">金匮</category><description>&lt;p&gt;杂病的范围牵扯很广，但是所有的方子基础都在伤寒论，所以一定要有伤寒论做为基础，伤寒论的观念是同症同治。金匮就是因为病的种类比较多，症状又都不一样，但是诊断方式还是以阴阳表里虚实寒热八纲辨症为主，处方也是用阴阳表里虚实寒热来区分，但还是同症同治。在刚开始介绍杂病的时候，张仲景就讲了一些内经的理论。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>